  "description": "Optional add-on for League of Legends Heroes: Veigar's Phenomenal Evil Power as in League - the ability power stacks he gathers are kept through death. The data pack cannot carry anything over a death (the game clears every buff), so there his stacks start again each life; this add-on remembers every stack and puts them back the moment death clears them. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
